definition.message:
{{#is_alert}}
Mirror member on IRIS instance {{host.name}} has left its healthy state: `intersystems_iris.mirror.status` is outside primary (2), backup (3), and connected (4). Check the metric for the current state (1:NOTINIT, 5:TRANSITION, 6:SYNCHRONIZING, 7:WAITING, 8:STOPPED, 9:CRASHED). Failover protection is reduced until the member returns to primary, backup, or connected.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_recovery}}
Mirror member on IRIS instance {{host.name}} has returned to a healthy state and is participating normally in the mirror again.
{{/is_recovery}}
